[0.004, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[1m                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[HAugust 21, NT157                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\nYou first came to Hogye when you were a very young child. As an orphan,         \r\nyou had no family to call your own. The people of this village took you         \r\nin and raised you among them. Since that time you've called this place          \r\nyour home.                                                                      \r\n                                                                                \r\nYou have no memories of your actual parents. You don't know what happened       \r\nto them, or why they had to abandon you. Sometimes you wonder about it.         \r\n                                                                                \r\nLife has been very good for you here, despite being a bit dull on times.        \r\nMany of your childhood friends have left home to find jobs in Snake             \r\nLake. Now you are preparing to begin your own journey.                          \r\n                                                                                \u001b[25;1H\u001b[32m\u001b[1m  [UP] to go up, [DOWN] to go down, [Q] or [ESC] to exit"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[14;81H\u001b(B\u001b[m\r \r\nAn exciting world is just waiting out there, full of adventure and              \r\nopportunity. It's time to go.                                                   \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n                                                                                \r\n"]
